<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78072" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραίτ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>supplication, entreaty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. παραιτεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					107a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδεμία τῆς μονῆς π.
			γιγνέσθω</span> no <i>application for leave</i> to stay, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				915c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόφασιν εἰσδέχεσθαι καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.17.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>petition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				899v21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>deprecating</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.73
			</span></i>; <i>excuse, apology</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				39.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.64a
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Chor.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
				1.73
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>pardon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαρτημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.296
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				223
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>declining</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.124b
			</span></i>; <i>dismissal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				78.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>intercession, begging off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gorg.
				<u>Pal.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				9.37
			</span></i>.</div>
